These six files are copied unchanged from gfxstream (codegen/gles2 and codegen/renderControl),
at commit 5b1155cd59132a5e838a9e615975d72bf2579294 of ejc3/gfxstream, a fork of
https://android.googlesource.com/platform/hardware/google/gfxstream. They are the emugen
specs gfxstream generates its GLES 2/3 and renderControl encoders and decoders from.
scripts/gen-mirror-table.ts reads them to write ../table.ts.

